<<getouticon>><<link [[返回补记房 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 21 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
朝圣的队伍比名册上写的早到了一天。三十多个人挤在门外，推着一辆盖油布的车，车上有病人，也有一个上了锁的木匣，说是某座小教堂的圣物。领队的老者把一卷盖了印的文书举过头顶，说路上遭了雨，脚程乱了，只求在殿里歇一夜。他身后的孩子已经坐在地上，鞋底磨穿，脚趾露在外面。
<br><br>
主教的意思是把人留在门外，等文书核清楚；悉尼已经搬了一张小桌到门房，说文书上的字他/她认得，只是需要一盏亮一点的灯。约旦从侧廊出来，看了看车上的病人，又看了看门外的天，说夜里要起雾，让这么多人睡在墙根，明天抬进来的就不是活人。管事修女夹在中间，手里攥着库房的钥匙，迟迟没有开门。
<br><br>
侧廊能腾出一段地方，但长椅要挪开，草垫不够，热水也要现烧。厨房还剩半袋燕麦，煮成稀粥勉强够分。车上的病人咳嗽得很厉害，额上覆着一块湿布，布已经温了。领队的老者说，他们带了盐和干鱼，可以换。木匣一直锁着，钥匙挂在老者脖子上，贴着皮肉。
<br><br>
门外的风把油布吹得鼓起又落下，车轴吱呀作响。悉尼把文书摊在小桌上，手指顺着印章的边缘摸过去，停在一处颜色略浅的地方。约旦没有看文书，只看着那个咳嗽的人。
<br><br>
车里铺着干草，草上躺着一个裹旧毯子的老人，呼吸很浅。旁边坐着的孩子一直盯着神殿的门看，像在数门上的铜钉。那口木匣用麻绳捆在车架上，匣角包着铁皮，铁皮上有一道新划的痕。领队的老者说，匣里是他们村教堂的圣物，路上遇到塌方，车翻过一次，匣子没有开。他说这话时，手一直按在胸口，像在确认什么还在。修女终于把库房钥匙插进锁孔，又拔出来，说草垫只够二十个人。悉尼抬起头，说文书上的印章缺了一角，和另一份对不上。门外的孩子站起来，拍了拍裤子上的土。
<br><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<link [[安置侧廊 (0:14)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 14>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<money 90>><<stress -3>><<tending 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[安置侧廊 (0:14)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 14>><<stress 6>><<tiredness 4>><<pain 1>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 240 or ($history or 0) gte 240>><<link [[查验文书 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[查验文书 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 170>><<link [[备粥铺草 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<money -170>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">备粥铺草 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回补记房 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 22 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
主教在回廊尽头等你。他/她手里没有念珠，只有一只封了蜡的信封，蜡上压着主教自己的印。他/她把信封递过来时，语气还是平常那样温和：「旧档室最里面那格柜子，有一卷不该再留的手抄本。你去取来，交给我，不必让第三个人知道。」廊下的灯照着他/她的侧脸，笑意很淡。
<br><br>
他/她顿了顿，又补一句：「约旦心软，见了那些字会睡不着。」说完便转身往钟塔的方向走，袍角扫过石阶，没有声音。信封不重，捏在手里却像压着一块石头。旧档室的钥匙挂在中层回廊的钩子上，钥匙环上还系着一小截褪色的红绳。
<br><br>
旧档室在最里面，门比别处矮，进门要低头。柜子一排排立着，最里面那格的锁孔有新擦过的痕迹，铜屑落在柜脚。那卷手抄本用蓝布包着，布角露出一行字，是你从没见过的写法。约旦此刻正在前殿，隔着两道门，能听见他/她低低的诵声。悉尼在谱室整理旧页，灯还亮着。
<br><br>
你把信封翻过来，封蜡上那道印压得很深。若照令取走，主教那边会记你一份；若先去问约旦，这封信就成了两个人之间的事；若交一只空匣回去，主教未必看得出来，可旧档室的门锁从此会换。廊下的风把灯焰吹得偏向一边，又慢慢直起来。
<br><br>
旧档室里没有窗，空气比走廊冷一截。柜子的木门被虫蛀出细孔，拉开时会掉下一点木屑。你把手伸进最里面那格，指尖先碰到蓝布，再往里，是一卷用细绳捆着的纸。绳结打得很紧，结头压着一小片干枯的蜡。走廊那头，前殿的诵声隔着两道门，低得几乎听不见。你把纸卷往外抽了半寸，又停住。封蜡的边缘有一道细裂，像是被人揭开又按回去过。你把信封对着灯照了照，里面只有一张折起的纸，字迹看不出来。旧档室的门在身后合上时，没有发出声音。走廊尽头的钟摆响了一下，很沉。你把钥匙在掌心里握紧，铜的凉意慢慢透上来。
<br><br>
<<mplockpickicon>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<link [[照令封卷 (0:12)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<money 120>><<stress -2>><<mpalert 2>><<mpalertgain "主教的侍从记住了你的脸">><</link>><<else>><<link [[照令封卷 (0:12)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link [[先告约旦 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<willpower 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[先告约旦 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 6>><<tiredness 3>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<link [[交只空匣 (0:12)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><<skulduggery 1>><<mpalert 5>><<mpalertgain "旧档室的锁孔留下了新痕">><</link>><<else>><<link [[交只空匣 (0:12)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回补记房 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Season Extra 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
补记房的石板边，另挂一块窄木牌，画着新藤、灯、谷穗和封蜡。管事的修士说，这是节令供桌的牌。杂役廊管的是殿里的杂活，这块牌管的是殿里一年四次把供物摆到祭坛前。
<br><br>
此刻是 <<if Time.season is "spring">>春天，后园的土刚化冻，葡萄架下积着一层湿叶<<elseif Time.season is "summer">>夏天，彩窗把日头滤得发白，长椅的木头摸上去发黏<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">>秋天，风里带着葡萄发酵的酸气，阶前总有扫不净的落叶<<elseif Time.season is "winter">>冬天，石阶结着薄冰，进殿的人都要扶一把门框<<else>>个节令含混的日子，天光压在檐口，迟迟不肯散<</if>>。窗外 <<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨脚一阵紧一阵松，檐口的木槽已经积了半槽浑水<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "snow">>雪把门槛埋了半寸，扫开的地方转眼又白<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "none">>日头把彩窗照得透亮，石面上的影子边缘很清楚<<else>>雾从街口漫过来，廊柱只剩下一道模糊的轮廓<</if>>。水尺上的雾位是 <<print ($mpFogTide or 0)>>；补记房的石板上，探索余 <<print $mpLocProgress_Temple>> 道刻痕，经手的事记了 <<print $mpLocEvents_Temple>> 笔。老修士把窄牌挂回钉子上，说：「供物是替人递的，不是替神收的。手要稳，心要静。」
<br><br>
<<if Time.season is "spring">>
开春的供物是新藤和头一茬麦穗。后园的葡萄藤刚抽须，挑藤要挑向阳那面，剪口斜着，插进铜瓶里才不会蔫。<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨点把新藤打得东倒西歪，若不先抢几枝回来，明天供桌上就只能摆陈枝。<<else>>日头温和，藤须软而韧，正适合编成一只小环，套在祭坛前的铜瓶口。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">><<mpherbicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<link [[抢护新藤 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[抢护新藤 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><<else>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 380>><<link [[编藤供环 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<tending 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[编藤供环 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><</if>><br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 150>><<link [[添买供烛 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<money -150>><<pass 8>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">添买供烛 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
<<elseif Time.season is "summer">>
入夏的供物是一盏长明灯和一碗凉水。灯要整夜不灭，水要从井里现汲，搁在祭坛西侧，替守夜的人压一压暑气。<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨气从窗缝钻进来，灯焰一跳一跳，得有人守着剪芯，不然一阵风就能把它掐灭。<<else>>井台被晒得发烫，井绳却是凉的；汲上来的水带着一点石头的腥气，正合供桌的规矩。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">><<mpwatchicon>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<link [[护住长明灯 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<willpower 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[护住长明灯 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<link [[擦亮灯罩 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<housekeeping 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[擦亮灯罩 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><</if>><br>
<<if ($money or 0) gte 150>><<link [[添买灯油 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<money -150>><<pass 8>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">添买灯油 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">>
秋天的供物是一束不脱粒的谷穗和头一道新酒。谷穗要挑穗头最沉的，用麻绳扎三道；新酒从酒窖抬上来，路上不能晃出桶口。<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨来得急，谷束还晾在场上，若不先抢收，穗头一泡水就会发黑。<<else>>天高风干，谷芒扎手，正适合编成一只冠，搁在祭坛前的木架上。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<link [[抢收谷束 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<athletics 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[抢收谷束 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><</link>><</if>><<else>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 380>><<link [[编谷穗冠 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<tending 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[编谷穗冠 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><</if>><br>
<<if ($money or 0) gte 180>><<link [[添买新酒 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<money -180>><<pass 8>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">添买新酒 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
<<elseif Time.season is "winter">>
冬天的供物是一块新封蜡和一撮净盐。封蜡要趁软捏成小饼，按在圣物匣口；盐要拿干锅炒过，装进白瓷碟。<<if Weather.precipitation is "snow">>雪压在阶上，蜡一冷就脆，得先扫出一条路，把蜡盆护在怀里，别让风灌进去。<<else>>天干冷，蜡块硬得像石头，得慢慢烘软，火大了会起泡，火小了又捏不动。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "snow">><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 380>><<link [[扫阶护蜡 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<athletics 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[扫阶护蜡 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>><</link>><</if>><<else>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<link [[熬蜡封坛 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<housekeeping 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[熬蜡封坛 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><</if>><br>
<<if ($money or 0) gte 160>><<link [[添买封蜡 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<money -160>><<pass 8>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">添买封蜡 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
节令牌上的画被潮气洇糊了，老修士说今天摆什么都行，只看供桌上还缺什么。祭坛前的灯还亮着，铜瓶空着，封蜡匣也开了口。窗外没有明显的雨雪，风却一阵紧过一阵。
<br><br>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 380>><<link [[替供桌打杂 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[替供桌打杂 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
